    Keep vphoned up when an element reports a NaN point
    
    ui.tap by label crashed vphoned whenever the frontmost app had an
    accessibility element with a NaN activation point: icli's
    icli_ax_elements_json handed the number to NSJSONSerialization, which
    threw. icli 0.7.10 falls back to the frame's centre and turns an
    unserializable bridge result into an error.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

